From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:14:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner DMIC driver

The A733, the D1 and the H6 have a DMIC controller. Build its driver as
a module, like the other Allwinner audio drivers.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the kernel builds the
DMIC driver as a module, which loads and registers the a733-dmic card.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 8547244e2a97..0d1d5bb4af12 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1125,6 +1125,7 @@ CONFIG_SND_SUN8I_CODEC_ANALOG=m
 CONFIG_SND_SUN50I_CODEC_ANALOG=m
 CONFIG_SND_SUN4I_I2S=m
 CONFIG_SND_SUN4I_SPDIF=m
+CONFIG_SND_SUN50I_DMIC=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_TEGRA=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_TEGRA210_AHUB=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_TEGRA210_DMIC=m
